                                                </subviews>
                                            </stackView>
                                            <label opaque="NO" userInteractionEnabled="NO" contentMode="left" horizontalHuggingPriority="251" verticalHuggingPriority="251" textAlignment="natural" lineBreakMode="tailTruncation" numberOfLines="0" baselineAdjustment="alignBaselines" adjustsFontSizeToFit="NO" translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints="NO" id="0DT-oI-Mn6">
                                                <rect key="frame" x="20" y="1091" width="984" height="17.5"/>
                                                <string key="text">Employees can be given raises incrementally within their Job Positions for experience, time with the company and performance factors.</string>
                                                <fontDescription key="fontDescription" name="Helvetica" family="Helvetica" pointSize="15"/>
                                                <nil key="textColor"/>
                                                <nil key="highlightedColor"/>
                                            </label>
                                            <label opaque="NO" userInteractionEnabled="NO" contentMode="left" horizontalHuggingPriority="251" verticalHuggingPriority="251" text="General Work Schedule:" textAlignment="natural" lineBreakMode="tailTruncation" baselineAdjustment="alignBaselines" adjustsFontSizeToFit="NO" translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints="NO" id="F6g-ky-1aY">
                                                <rect key="frame" x="20" y="1128.5" width="231" height="23"/>
                                                <fontDescription key="fontDescription" name="Helvetica-Bold" family="Helvetica" pointSize="20"/>
                                                <nil key="textColor"/>
                                                <nil key="highlightedColor"/>
                                            </label>
                                            <label opaque="NO" userInteractionEnabled="NO" contentMode="left" horizontalHuggingPriority="251" verticalHuggingPriority="251" textAlignment="natural" lineBreakMode="tailTruncation" numberOfLines="0" baselineAdjustment="alignBaselines" adjustsFontSizeToFit="NO" translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints="NO" id="MV6-vY-tZg">
                                                <rect key="frame" x="20" y="1161.5" width="984" height="86.5"/>
                                                <string key="text">There is no set schedule or guarantee of work, you will be provided with a schedule weekly.
Over 40 hours in this period is paid overtime. Employees may be required to work overtime.
Daily start times are established by the supervisor of each training site or work location. 
Employees must take two paid 10 minutes breaks and one unpaid 30 minute lunch break daily. Start times for break and lunch are determined by the job-site foreman.</string>
                                                <fontDescription key="fontDescription" name="Helvetica" family="Helvetica" pointSize="15"/>
                                                <nil key="textColor"/>
                                                <nil key="highlightedColor"/>
                                            </label>
                                            <label opaque="NO" userInteractionEnabled="NO" contentMode="left" horizontalHuggingPriority="251" verticalHuggingPriority="251" text="Paid Sick Leave Policy:" textAlignment="natural" lineBreakMode="tailTruncation" baselineAdjustment="alignBaselines" adjustsFontSizeToFit="NO" translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints="NO" id="7La-jU-DOg">
                                                <rect key="frame" x="20" y="1268" width="222.5" height="23"/>
                                                <fontDescription key="fontDescription" name="Helvetica-Bold" family="Helvetica" pointSize="20"/>
                                                <nil key="textColor"/>
                                                <nil key="highlightedColor"/>
                                            </label>
                                            <label opaque="NO" userInteractionEnabled="NO" contentMode="left" horizontalHuggingPriority="251" verticalHuggingPriority="251" textAlignment="natural" lineBreakMode="tailTruncation" numberOfLines="0" baselineAdjustment="alignBaselines" adjustsFontSizeToFit="NO" translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints="NO" id="qih-bb-jc8">
                                                <rect key="frame" x="20" y="1301" width="984" height="172.5"/>
                                                <string key="text">Paid sick leave shall accrue at a minimum rate of 1 hour of paid sick leave for every 40 hours worked as an employee.
An employee is entitled to use accrued paid sick leave beginning on the 90th calendar day after the start of employment.
Unused paid sick leave of 40 hours or less will be carried over to the following year.
Employees may use paid sick leave to care for themselves or a family member.
An employee may use paid sick leave when the employee's work or the employee's child's school or place of care has been closed by order of a public official for any health-related reason.
An employee may use paid sick leave for absences that qualify for leave under the state's Domestic Violence Leave Act.
Use of sick leave for vacation time will result in disciplinary action.
Employees may also use Washington State’s Paid Family and Medical leave program.
Employees are only eligible to use sick leave for classes they were scheduled for and have to miss because of sickness that day.</string>
                                                <fontDescription key="fontDescription" name="Helvetica" family="Helvetica" pointSize="15"/>
                                                <nil key="textColor"/>
                                                <nil key="highlightedColor"/>
                                            </label>
                                            <label opaque="NO" userInteractionEnabled="NO" contentMode="left" horizontalHuggingPriority="251" verticalHuggingPriority="251" text="Sexual Harassment and Bullying:" textAlignment="natural" lineBreakMode="tailTruncation" baselineAdjustment="alignBaselines" adjustsFontSizeToFit="NO" translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints="NO" id="QxY-N4-efh">
                                                <rect key="frame" x="20" y="1493.5" width="317" height="23"/>
                                                <fontDescription key="fontDescription" name="Helvetica-Bold" family="Helvetica" pointSize="20"/>
                                                <nil key="textColor"/>
                                                <nil key="highlightedColor"/>
                                            </label>
                                            <label opaque="NO" userInteractionEnabled="NO" contentMode="left" horizontalHuggingPriority="251" verticalHuggingPriority="251" textAlignment="natural" lineBreakMode="tailTruncation" numberOfLines="0" baselineAdjustment="alignBaselines" adjustsFontSizeToFit="NO" translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints="NO" id="d1D-Zq-LU1">
                                                <rect key="frame" x="20" y="1526.5" width="984" height="121"/>
                                                <string key="text">No act of sexual harassment or bullying will be tolerated. This includes offensive jokes, name calling, slurs, explicit comments, unwanted staring or leering, physical conduct or assault, and sharing visual images in hard or electronic form of pornography or graphic images.
Employees shall conduct themselves with respectful professional behavior to other employees, management, and our customers.
We encourage those who feel they are being harassed to tell the harasser their actions are not welcome and must stop.
We have a zero tolerance anti-bullying policy and expect supervisors to intervene constructively by reporting the situation to the humans resource contact and noting the resolution or actions taken.
We encourage victims or witnesses to report any incidents of bullying and sexual harassment to the human resource contact immediately.</string>
                                                <fontDescription key="fontDescription" name="Helvetica" family="Helvetica" pointSize="15"/>
                                                <nil key="textColor"/>
                                                <nil key="highlightedColor"/>
                                            </label>
                                            <label opaque="NO" userInteractionEnabled="NO" contentMode="left" horizontalHuggingPriority="251" verticalHuggingPriority="251" text="Disciplinary Policy:" textAlignment="natural" lineBreakMode="tailTruncation" baselineAdjustment="alignBaselines" adjustsFontSizeToFit="NO" translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints="NO" id="RnN-EA-8Am">
                                                <rect key="frame" x="20" y="1667.5" width="185" height="23"/>
                                                <fontDescription key="fontDescription" name="Helvetica-Bold" family="Helvetica" pointSize="20"/>
                                                <nil key="textColor"/>
                                                <nil key="highlightedColor"/>
                                            </label>
                                            <label opaque="NO" userInteractionEnabled="NO" contentMode="left" horizontalHuggingPriority="251" verticalHuggingPriority="251" textAlignment="natural" lineBreakMode="tailTruncation" numberOfLines="0" baselineAdjustment="alignBaselines" adjustsFontSizeToFit="NO" translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints="NO" id="rFo-ML-jif">
                                                <rect key="frame" x="20" y="1700.5" width="984" height="69"/>
                                                <string key="text">Employees have responsibilities to follow our company policy.   It is designed to give employees who make mistakes a chance, but also to remove people who are not contributing properly to the team environment. 
Professionalism is key to our success and we hold our employees to a higher than usual standard.
The listed actions will result if an employee breaks a company policy or acts in such a way to require discipline.</string>
                                                <fontDescription key="fontDescription" name="Helvetica" family="Helvetica" pointSize="15"/>
                                                <nil key="textColor"/>
                                                <nil key="highlightedColor"/>
                                            </label>
                                            <stackView opaque="NO" contentMode="scaleToFill" axis="vertical" distribution="fillEqually" translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints="NO" id="Pmj-9r-vga">
                                                <rect key="frame" x="20" y="1774.5" width="984" height="60"/>
                                                <subviews>
                                                    <view contentMode="scaleToFill" translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints="NO" id="0NO-iU-uNp">
                                                        <rect key="frame" x="0.0" y="0.0" width="984" height="20"/>
                                                        <subviews>
                                                            <imageView clipsSubviews="YES" userInteractionEnabled="NO" contentMode="scaleAspectFit" horizontalHuggingPriority="251" verticalHuggingPriority="251" image="black-circle" translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints="NO" id="m9n-ch-0dF">
                                                                <rect key="frame" x="5" y="5" width="10" height="10"/>
                                                                <constraints>
                                                                    <constraint firstAttribute="height" constant="10" id="XSr-BS-kKR"/>
                                                                    <constraint firstAttribute="width" constant="10" id="kPL-HU-Ayi"/>
                                                                </constraints>
                                                            </imageView>
                                                            <label opaque="NO" userInteractionEnabled="NO" contentMode="left" horizontalHuggingPriority="251" verticalHuggingPriority="251" text="Verbal Warning" textAlignment="natural" lineBreakMode="tailTruncation" baselineAdjustment="alignBaselines" adjustsFontSizeToFit="NO" translatesAutoresizingMaskIntoConstraints="NO" id="WQu-es-bQ8">
                                                                <rect key="frame" x="25" y="0.0" width="959" height="20"/>
