                                                <string key="text">commercially accepted method, to my (our) account(s) indicated below and to other accounts I (we) identify in the future (the “Account”). This authorizes the financial institution holding the Account to post all such entries. I agree that the ACH transactions authorized herein shall comply with all applicable U.S. Law. This authorization will be in effect until the Company receives a written termination notice from myself and has a reasonable opportunity to act on it.</string>
